<title>MALAYSIA: Berjaya Group, Halim Mazmin suspended.</title>
<headline>Berjaya Group, Halim Mazmin suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stocks of diversified Berjaya Group Bhd and shipping concern Halim Mazmin Bhd were suspended on Tuesday at the companies' requests, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Berjaya Group closed at 3.10 ringgit, while Halim Mazmin ended at 14.60 ringgit on Monday. Officials at both companies could not immediately be reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
